                <mxCell id="207" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(248, 248, 242); background-color: rgb(39, 40, 34); font-family: &amp;quot;Droid Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;monospace&amp;quot;, monospace; font-weight: normal; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #66d9ef;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;@brief&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; Construct a new Server:: Server object by looping through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #66d9ef;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;@param&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #fd971f;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;serverConfigsVec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; and for each configuration, it will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * 1. create the epollfd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * 2. loop through the vector of all the configs and create one listenfd for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * each config, bind that listenfd to the specific port in the config,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * update the map of _listenFds with a fd &amp;lt;==&amp;gt; configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * 3. because fds are created incrementally, it will start at 5, 6, 7 etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * (0 stdin, 1 stdout, 2 stderr, 3 epollfd, 4 listeningsocket, 5 listeningsocket)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #88846f;&quot;&gt; * so &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=13;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-426" y="270" width="650" height="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
